# oracle: improper_style umbrella, the sign of cos(omega) from the copies nearest to the improper owner atom 2 (96 atoms, 48 impropers, 50 steps)
# oracle-inputs: w186um_chains.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# native: b332f28 (/home/roy/.local/bin/lmp). Measured with native LAMMPS: the sign rule (projhfg in improper_umbrella.cpp) uses x[i2]-x[i1] and x[i4]-x[i1] with copies nearest to atom 2 (molecule.cpp stores an improper with atom2; ntopo_improper_template.cpp calls closest_image around it). With copies nearest to atom 1 the engine split from native at step 31 (force on atom 9 off by 0.16).
# Measured with the fixed engine: max abs per-atom error 4.1e-13 (max relative 1.4e-12); eimp at step 50 agrees to 4e-15 relative.
units           lj
atom_style      full
read_data       w186um_chains.data
pair_style      lj/cut 1.2
pair_coeff      * * 0.0 1.0
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 30.0 1.0
bond_coeff      2 20.0 1.1
angle_style     harmonic
angle_coeff     1 20.0 110.0
angle_coeff     2 15.0 120.0
dihedral_style  harmonic
dihedral_coeff  1 20.0 1 2
dihedral_coeff  2 10.0 -1 3
improper_style  umbrella
improper_coeff  1 4.0 60.0
improper_coeff  2 3.0 80.0
velocity        all create 0.5 4711 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step eimp pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          25
run             50
